{
  "type": "mod",
  "id": 1292,
  "hub_id": 1804,
  "guid": "com.samswat.helicrash.arysreloaded",
  "name": "SamSWAT's Helicopter Crash Sites - Arys Reloaded",
  "slug": "samswats-helicopter-crash-sites-arys-reloaded",
  "teaser": "SamSWAT's Helicopter Crash Sites - DayZ inspired helicrashes now in Tarkov",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/1804.jpg",
  "downloads": 50975,
  "favourites_count": 56,
  "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/659-helicopter-crash-sites/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Original Mod by SamSWAT</a></p>\n<p>A BepInEx client mod that adds DayZ-inspired helicopter crashes to SPT.</p>\n<h3>— FIKA USERS —</h3>\n<p>You need the <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/addon/12/samswats-helicopter-crash-sites-arys-reloaded-fika-sync\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Fika Sync addon</a> to make the mod work on Fika. Please follow the install instructions on the Fika Sync addon’s page.</p>\n<h3>————————</h3>\n<p>Helicopter crash sites have a configurable spawn chance (default is 10%), and can spawn with a lootable crate (the default crate spawn chance is 100% and is also configurable).</p>\n<p>This mod was originally made by SamSWAT, was updated by Tyrian for 3.7.x and now I’m maintaining the mod, for the foreseeable future.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">HOW TO INSTALL</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Download and install the dependency mod UnityToolkit</li>\n<li>Download this mod and open the file with 7-Zip</li>\n<li>Drag and drop the <strong>BepInEx</strong> folder into your game folder (not the SPT folder inside your game folder!)</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>SamSWAT - creator of the original mod</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Tyrian - codebase I inherited from</strong></p></div></div></div>\n",
  "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1292/samswats-helicopter-crash-sites-arys-reloaded",
